# The cases of faults_host.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT, see
# tests/CMakeLists.txt. The runtime takes the first five allocations at
# the start of the program. The load opens the library with the first
# open and takes the sixth allocation for its slot, and instance the
# seventh for the object. T139: memory that runs out in the loader is a
# failure of the load and of instance, where the program must stop.
open_refused open:1:EACCES
slot_memory alloc:6:ENOMEM
object_memory alloc:7:ENOMEM
